msgctxt "164"
msgid "(I've been asking around, but nobody else has taken me up on it...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"(Please, if you could just let me win one match against you, I'd be real "
"grateful.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "I told you. I'm not your man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"(Urk... But you're my only hope! Think it over, okay? And come back if you "
"change your mind.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Well, all right. I guess I could stand a game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "(Thank you so much! Now, let's get down to business...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Kanae-chan? This guy wants to play darts, so I'm just gonna have a quick "
"round with him, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Oh, okay. I didn't know you could play darts, Masaki-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Sure I can! I don't wanna brag, but I'm pretty famous for it around these "
"parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Anyhow, I better go get ready! Gotta check the shafts and flights, and "
"stuff. I'll be right back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "(Excuse me, but... did he ask you to lose on purpose?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You're pretty sharp."
msgstr "Sei piuttosto felice."

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"He probably just wants to show off. That's what he always does, and I'm kind"
" of sick of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Would you beat the pants off him? Maybe that'll teach him a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Oops! He's coming back. Don't forget what I said, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "My darts are ready for action. How about you? Ready to get started?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "We'll play a game of '01. Ready? Let's go!"
msgstr ""

